WEBVTT

00:03:58.985 --> 00:04:00.861
because we already have infrastructure

00:04:00.861 --> 00:04:02.905
for the chemical
and fertilizer industries.

00:04:02.905 --> 00:04:04.991
Now it just needs to be built near ports,

00:04:04.991 --> 00:04:06.158
and at a global scale --

00:04:06.158 --> 00:04:07.702
and with great caution.

00:04:08.494 --> 00:04:11.330
So what's needed
to take ammonia mainstream?

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.125
We can draw a rough parallel
to the rise of electric cars.

00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:15.710
A decade ago,

00:04:15.751 --> 00:04:18.504
about 17,000 EVs
were on the roads worldwide.

00:04:18.546 --> 00:04:20.756
Then, more and more countries
adopted policies,

00:04:20.798 --> 00:04:22.341
encouraging people to buy EVs,

00:04:22.383 --> 00:04:25.094
supporting manufacturers

00:04:25.094 --> 00:04:27.096
and to build up charging infrastructure.

00:04:27.638 --> 00:04:30.516
And as sales climbed
and production boomed,